# Submodule working trees. These are tracked via .gitmodules (gitlinks), so
# git itself ignores this section for staging purposes — listing them here
# just nudges editors and search tools (ripgrep, deno fmt/lint, IDE indexers)
# to skip them when scanning the workspace.
